msgid ":gh:`104873`: Add :func:`typing.get_protocol_members` to return the set of members defining a :class:`typing.Protocol`.  Add :func:`typing.is_protocol` to check whether a class is a :class:`typing.Protocol`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
